      "start_seconds": 1.31,
      "end_seconds": 4.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.89,
      "end_seconds": 10.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.39,
      "end_seconds": 16.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Mainly I've been forgetting recent things. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.41,
      "end_seconds": 21.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.33,
      "end_seconds": 30.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "around two years... no wait, it's more like nearly five years. I've also been misplacing things"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.4,
      "end_seconds": 52.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.11,
      "end_seconds": 57.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.94,
      "end_seconds": 60.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.66,
      "end_seconds": 64.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.04,
      "end_seconds": 84.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.34,
      "end_seconds": 97.12,
      "duration_seconds": 11.78,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years. No, I share a house with my brother. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.74,
      "end_seconds": 118.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.41,
      "end_seconds": 121.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.69,
      "end_seconds": 126.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Any falls, headache or weakness on one side at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.34,
      "end_seconds": 130.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.42,
      "end_seconds": 133.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.33,
      "end_seconds": 137.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.24,
      "end_seconds": 153.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "time for your numbers, if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.36,
      "end_seconds": 168.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.08,
      "end_seconds": 192.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, heart rate 76, blood pressure 126 over 79, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.56,
      "end_seconds": 195.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.1,
      "end_seconds": 199.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "that's fine, I'll explain it it soon"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.18,
      "end_seconds": 206.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.58,
      "end_seconds": 209.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.5,
      "end_seconds": 214.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "alright, I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.33,
      "end_seconds": 235.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "the memory test score is a little low today and the rest of the neurological check is normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.9,
      "end_seconds": 237.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.15,
      "end_seconds": 251.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.81,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is a gradual memory problem that needs further assessment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.67,
      "end_seconds": 255.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.78,
      "end_seconds": 285.32,
      "duration_seconds": 28.54,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a gradual memory problem that needs further assessment do well once it's treated properly. We should do blood tests for memory loss. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Keep a daily routine and write things down, a notebook by the door works well. I'm going to send a referral to the older adults' assessment service"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.28,
      "end_seconds": 289.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.92,
      "end_seconds": 304.68,
      "duration_seconds": 11.76,
      "text": "If you become suddenly confused, that's the point to come in urgently. Let's review you after the results. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.98,
      "end_seconds": 309.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "okay, that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    }
  ]
